OL,3,GNEWSACouncil reverses decision to close
OL,4,Aaviary
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn aviary which was due to close
OL,7,Fbecause of council budget cuts and
OL,8,F"concerns over animal welfare" will
OL,9,Fstay open after a U-turn.
OL,11,FA legal challenge by campaigners
OL,12,Fprotesting against the closure of the
OL,13,Faviary in the Botanic Gardens in
OL,14,FChurchtown, Southport was launched last
OL,15,Fmonth. Sefton council said it would be
OL,16,Ftoo costly to fight.
OL,18,FThe local authority said in June it
OL,19,Fwanted to shut the attraction because
OL,20,Fof running costs and the wellbeing of
OL,21,Fthe 170 birds which live there.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
